# Written for this pack by BurN-30 (GPL-3.0). Replaces 08b-prison.guide on Polestar's own route, with
# the end of the Defias story (393 to 396) that 12-dalaran.guide carried. Same sources: quest ids,
# givers, places and levels from Polestar's Forever data (data-v2026.11.1 and the forever-db of
# Polestar 0.4.2.2) and its Dungeons codex; bosses, quest drops and tips from Wowhead Forever (quest
# and NPC pages and their comments, read on 2026-11-08), the story's event tips from Wowhead Forever
# comments (October and November 2026), rewritten. Polestar 0.4.2.2's run (GPL-3.0,
# data/dungeon-runs.json and its `when dungeon "The Stockade"` steps of forever/alliance/06-wetlands):
# the gate at Stormwind 52.4,70.0, Bazil Thredd (389) then The Stockade Riots (391) at the Warden's.
# Not played in game yet.
#
# Self-contained chapter for Polestar's route: the Groupe Alliance module offers it on the last
# Stormwind stop of forever/alliance/05-duskwood (Seeking Wisdom, 269, to Bishop Farthing, or Caretaker
# Folsom's Sealed Crate, 72), about level 28-29, before the flight to the Wetlands; else on the last
# Stormwind stop of forever/alliance/06-wetlands (Cleansing the Eye, 293, to Archbishop Benedictus),
# about 30-31, where Polestar's own run was. Every giver and every hand-in is in Stormwind.
# Since 0.13.0 the chapter has the id its guide had up to 0.12.x (groupe-alliance/08b-prison): a tab saved on it opens
# the chapter.
#
# Compared with Polestar's run: the same Warden's quests; added The Color of Blood (388, Nikova
# Raskol in Old Town, the bandanas of the run), The Curious Visitor and the end of the Defias story
# (392 to 396: Lescovar, the Seal of Wrynn), the bosses one by one, and Bazil Thredd taken from Baros
# Alexston for whoever handed in the Deadmines' letter without it. Left out, as by Polestar: What
# Comes Around (386, Lakeshire), Crime and Punishment (377, Darkshire) and The Fury Runs Deep (378,
# Dun Modr): their givers are off the route then; their hand-ins stay for a character who carries
# them from this pack's former route.
guide groupe-alliance/08b-prison
title Dungeon · The Stockade (25-31)
folder Group Alliance
category Dungeons
faction Alliance
levels 25-31
zone Stormwind City

step Baros Alexston: Bazil Thredd (after the Deadmines)
  when available 389
  zone Stormwind City
  tip Baros Alexston, in the City Hall on Cathedral Square, sends whoever handed in VanCleef's Unsent Letter to Warden Thelwater: it opens The Stockade Riots, the prison's best quest.
  accept 389                                  -- Baros Alexston

step Stormwind: Warden Thelwater
  zone Stormwind City
  tip The Stockade, Stormwind's prison taken over by rioting Defias, is a group dungeon in the canals between the Mage Quarter and Old Town, levels 24 to 32 in the group finder: at 26 or more it goes well. Warden Thelwater keeps its gate, south of the Cathedral Square.
  note Keep 6 free quest log slots. Everyone takes the quests on their own; meet at the prison gate for the run.
  accept 387                                  -- Warden Thelwater

step Warden Thelwater: Bazil Thredd (after the Deadmines)
  when onquest 389
  zone Stormwind City
  turnin 389                                  -- Warden Thelwater
  accept 391                                  -- The Stockade Riots

step Old Town: Nikova Raskol
  zone Stormwind City
  tip Nikova Raskol stands in Old Town: the Red Wool Bandanas she wants drop from the Defias inside.
  accept 388                                  -- Nikova Raskol

# The accepts of two quests carried from this pack's former route, for their objective lines inside
# (the compiler wants an accept before them). Done at once for whoever carries them: no text of their
# own, the advice is on the objective's line (Head of Targorr, Hand of Dextren Ward).
step What Comes Around, for whoever carries it
  when onquest 386
  accept 386

step Crime and Punishment, for whoever carries it
  when onquest 377
  accept 377

step Enter the Stockade
  tip The gate is by Warden Thelwater, at the top of the stairs on the canal. Group of 5 at 24 to 29, or 3 at 26 to 29. Every prisoner is elite (23 to 26); the Defias Prisoners disarm, so the tank builds threat before anyone hits.
  note In the log before going in: Quell the Uprising and The Stockade Riots (Warden Thelwater), The Color of Blood (Nikova Raskol). Share each quest with the group: click it in the quest log, then Share.
  goto 52.4,70.0 "The Stockade" r 20 live

step The entry corridor and Targorr
  tip Cells line both sides, 3 or 4 elites each, and runners flee into the next cell for help: stop them or clear each cell as you pass. Targorr the Dread hides in a side cell of this corridor (often first on the right or second on the left); a patrol walks between the two wings.
  note Red Wool Bandanas and the prisoners for Quell the Uprising come from every Defias.
  kill 1696                                   -- Targorr the Dread
  collect 3630 quest 386                      -- Head of Targorr: Targorr the Dread, elite 24. For What Comes Around (Guard Berton, Lakeshire): the hand-in comes after the run.
  note At the junction, type /target Bruegal Ironknuckle: if a frame shows, the rare elite (26) is in a cell nearby, with the best loot of the dungeon.

step The west wing: Dextren Ward
  tip Left at the junction, to the small hall at the end. Clear every room around it first: his Intimidating Shout fears the group into fresh packs. He runs at low health: stop him.
  kill 1663                                   -- Dextren Ward
  collect 3628 quest 377                      -- Hand of Dextren Ward, elite 26. For Crime and Punishment (Councilman Millstipe, Darkshire): the hand-in comes after the run.

step The east wing: Kam, Hamhock and Bazil Thredd
  tip Right at the junction. Kam Deepfury sits in a cell (second on the left); Hamhock comes with two linked Insurgents and casts Chain Lightning: crowd-control an add and spread out. Bazil Thredd waits at the very end: he hits one target hard and his Smoke Bomb stuns, so keep the tank topped up.
  kill 1666                                   -- Kam Deepfury
  kill 1717                                   -- Hamhock
  kill 1716                                   -- Bazil Thredd
  collect 2926 quest 391                      -- Head of Bazil Thredd, elite 29

step Finish the clear
  tip One Convict short after a full clear? Wait a few minutes at the entrance for the respawn rather than resetting. Two chests, one in each wing. Leaving through the portal drops whatever chases you.
  complete 387                                -- Defias Prisoners, Convicts and Insurgents
  collect 2909 quest 388                      -- Red Wool Bandana: any Defias inside

step Warden Thelwater
  zone Stormwind City
  turnin 387                                  -- Warden Thelwater

step Warden Thelwater: The Stockade Riots
  when complete 391
  zone Stormwind City
  turnin 391                                  -- Warden Thelwater

step Warden Thelwater: The Curious Visitor (the end of the Defias story)
  when group 392
  when turnedin 391
  zone Stormwind City
  tip The end of the Defias story follows, all in Stormwind and at the farm by its gate: about 8,000 XP and the Seal of Wrynn, a ring, at the end; its last fight is better with the group. Short on time? Skip it: Nikova Raskol in Old Town ends the chapter.
  accept 392                                  -- The Curious Visitor: for Baros Alexston, Cathedral Square

# The end of the Defias story: only after The Stockade Riots, every hand-in optional so that the
# chapter ends on its own quests (387, 388) for whoever leaves the story aside.
step Baros Alexston: The Curious Visitor
  when onquest 392
  zone Stormwind City
  tip Baros Alexston is in the City Hall on Cathedral Square.
  turnin 392                                  -- Baros Alexston

step Stormwind: the end of the Defias story
  when turnedin 392
  tip Only if you did The Stockade Riots. Baros Alexston is in the City Hall on Cathedral Square, Mathias Shaw upstairs at SI:7 in Old Town, Elling Trias upstairs in the cheese shop of the Trade District, Tyrion in the garden beside Stormwind Keep.
  accept 393                                  -- Baros Alexston
  turnin 393                                  -- Master Mathias Shaw
  accept 350
  turnin 350                                  -- Elling Trias
  accept 2745
  turnin 2745                                 -- Tyrion
  accept 2746

step Clara's apples
  when onquest 2746
  zone Elwynn Forest
  tip The bowl of apples sits on the table of the farmhouse just outside the Stormwind gate, south-west of the road. Silk Cloth: from your bags, humanoids or the Auction House.
  collect 8683 x2 quest 2746 @33.95,57.16     -- Clara's Fresh Apple
  collect 4306 x3 quest 2746                  -- Silk Cloth

step The Attack!
  when onquest 2746
  zone Stormwind City
  tip Lord Gregor Lescovar and Marzon the Silent Blade meet in the garden beside the keep: listen to them, then fight both, together. Better with the group.
  turnin 2746                                 -- Tyrion
  accept 434
  complete 434 @72.36,35.12                   -- Overhear Lescovar and Marzon in the garden, then kill both

step Brotherhood's End
  when complete 434
  turnin 434                                  -- Elling Trias
  accept 394
  turnin 394                                  -- Master Mathias Shaw
  accept 395
  turnin 395                                  -- Baros Alexston
  accept 396
  turnin 396                                  -- Lady Katrana Prestor, in the throne room of Stormwind Keep: Seal of Wrynn

# Only for a character who carries them from this pack's former route.
step Lakeshire: Guard Berton
  zone Redridge Mountains
  when complete 386
  tip Fly to Lakeshire and back: a few minutes for the biggest reward of the prison.
  fly "Lakeshire"
  turnin 386                                  -- Guard Berton

step Darkshire: Councilman Millstipe
  zone Duskwood
  when complete 377
  fly "Darkshire"
  turnin 377                                  -- Councilman Millstipe, town hall

step Old Town: Nikova Raskol
  zone Stormwind City
  tip Last stop of the chapter: the route's own guide comes back once this is handed in.
  turnin 388                                  -- Nikova Raskol
